Source: h3-pg
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13),
               cmake (>= 3.20),
               postgresql-server-dev-all
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/postgis/h3-pg
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/pgsty/deb/tree/main/debbuild/h3
Vcs-Git: https://github.com/pgsty/deb.git

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-h3
Architecture: any
Depends: postgresql-PGVERSION-postgis-3,
         postgresql-PGVERSION-postgis-3-scripts,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${postgresql:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Breaks: ${postgresql:Breaks}
Description: H3 hierarchical geospatial indexing for PostgreSQL
 This package contains the h3 and h3_postgis extensions, with a statically
 linked H3 core. h3 provides hierarchical hexagonal cell indexing;
 h3_postgis integrates cells with PostGIS geometry, geography, and raster.
